From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The Playport authors <dev@playport.dev>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 11:15:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] kk: MESA_KK_DEBUG=no_compression keeps every image's texels
 plain

A Metal GPU capture stores a heap's memory as it is. An image with
GPU-optimized contents (allowGPUOptimizedContents, which KosmicKrisp
gives optimal-tiling images it can) is losslessly compressed and
twiddled there, so a render target placed in a heap cannot be read from
the capture on this workstation. With the flag no image gets optimized
contents: the capture's heap snapshots hold each texture's texels, which
the frame's render targets can then be read from command buffer to
command buffer. It costs bandwidth on every render target, so it is for
captures only.

Linear: PLA-815
Class: diagnostics
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-11-03-dirt5-xbox-minidump-apiset.md
Offered-upstream: no
---
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c        | 1 +
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h        | 4 ++++
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_image_layout.c | 4 ++++
 3 files changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c
index fc62ff6..a5657cf 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c
@@ -32,6 +32,7 @@ const struct debug_named_value debug_flags[] = {
    {"passes", KK_DEBUG_PASSES},
    {"vertex_stats", KK_DEBUG_VERTEX_STATS},
    {"descriptor_stats", KK_DEBUG_DESCRIPTOR_STATS},
+   {"no_compression", KK_DEBUG_NO_COMPRESSION},
    {NULL, 0},
 };
 
diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h
index 6dd5544..9abb6f0 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h
@@ -68,6 +68,10 @@ enum kk_debug {
    KK_DEBUG_VERTEX_STATS = 1ull << 15,
    /* PLA-431: cumulative legacy resource descriptor counts/elapsed time. */
    KK_DEBUG_DESCRIPTOR_STATS = 1ull << 16,
+   /* Playport (PLA-815): no image gets Metal's GPU-optimized contents
+    * (lossless compression, twiddling), so a GPU capture's heap snapshots
+    * hold every texture's texels as they are */
+   KK_DEBUG_NO_COMPRESSION = 1ull << 17,
 };
 
 extern enum kk_debug kk_mesa_debug_flags;
diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_image_layout.c b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_image_layout.c
index 1e55a62..1f2b80d 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_image_layout.c
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_image_layout.c
@@ -92,6 +92,10 @@ kk_image_layout_can_optimize(const struct kk_physical_device *pdev,
    if (tiling != VK_IMAGE_TILING_OPTIMAL)
       return false;
 
+   /* Playport (PLA-815): MESA_KK_DEBUG=no_compression, for reading captures */
+   if (KK_DEBUG(NO_COMPRESSION))
+      return false;
+
    /* Cannot optimize if host transfer for a format that would use Apple's
     * lossless compression. Otherwise, CTS tests which populate memory with
     * random data fail due to differences in how invalid optimized data is
